# about:data (cavekit-site-data.md R3, T-663): the test form's site sets two cookies, keeps 4 KB in localStorage and 8 KB
# in IndexedDB, and a login and a note are submitted (the note goes into the form history); the same page on a second
# origin of the host (:8079, fixture second-origin) keeps its own. about:data lists one site for the host, with its
# counts, and its search narrows the list; the site's page lists both origins' stored data, shows a cookie (its value on
# demand), removes it and then every cookie; Pop-up windows set to Block is what the engine then holds; the logins' link
# opens about:logins narrowed to the site; :8077's local storage and databases each cleared, :8079's left; Forget this
# site, after its confirm, empties the site (both origins) and it leaves the list. The form history holds the note and
# the username, its search narrows it (and says when nothing matches); the note removed alone, then all removed.
id: site-data-page
section: Privacy and site data
item: about:data lists the site with its cookies, stored data and logins, and its search narrows the list; its page shows and removes a cookie and all the site's cookies, changes a permission, links the site's logins, shows and clears the stored data; Forget this site clears it all; the form history lists, removes a typed note and removes all
shells: enyo mochi mojo
prefs: jihad.compat.trace=true signon.rememberSignons=true browser.formfill.enable=true
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-login.html
kit: cavekit-site-data.md R3
fixture: site-data-clean second-origin
wait rect user 30
probe submit '(function(u,p){document.getElementById("user").value=u;document.getElementById("pass").value=p;document.getElementById("note").value="hello jihad";return "filled "+u;})("jihad-data","data-pass-8")'
tap go
expect dialog present 8
chrome dialog-ok
expect dialog answered 8
wait text sent "sent jihad-data" 15
launch http://192.168.1.245:8079/jihad-login.html
wait text state "user=" 10
launch about:data
wait text sites "192.168.1.245" 10
expect text-lacks sites ":8079"
wait text 'sel:.site-row[data-site="192.168.1.245"] .site-counts' "stored" 10
expect text-has 'sel:.site-row[data-site="192.168.1.245"] .site-counts' "1 login"
tap 'sel:#search'
type zz-no-such-site
wait text sites "No site matches" 4
launch about:data
wait text sites "192.168.1.245" 10
tap 'sel:.site-row[data-site="192.168.1.245"] .site-open'
wait text cookies "jihadtest" 10
tap 'sel:.cookie-row[data-name="jihadtest"] .cookie-show'
wait text 'sel:.cookie-row[data-name="jihadtest"] .cookie-value' "1" 4
wait text storage "KB" 10
wait text storage "192.168.1.245:8079" 10
expect text-has site-logins "1 saved login"
pick 'sel:.perm-row[data-perm="popup"][data-origin="http://192.168.1.245:8077"] select' 2 3
wait text status "Pop-up windows for http://192.168.1.245:8077: Block" 6
launch about:data?site=192.168.1.245
wait rect 'sel:.perm-row[data-perm="popup"][data-origin="http://192.168.1.245:8077"][data-value="2"]' 10
tap 'sel:.cookie-row[data-name="jihadtest"] .cookie-remove'
wait text status "removed" 6
expect text-lacks cookies "jihadtest"
tap 'sel:.cookies-remove-all'
wait text status "Every cookie" 6
expect text-lacks cookies "jihadsecond"
tap 'sel:.site-logins-open'
wait url about:logins?filter=192.168.1.245 10
wait text logins "jihad-data" 10
launch about:data?site=192.168.1.245
wait text storage "local storage" 10
wait text storage "databases" 10
tap 'sel:.storage-row[data-kind="local"][data-origin^="http://192.168.1.245:8077"] .storage-clear'
wait gone 'sel:.storage-row[data-kind="local"][data-origin^="http://192.168.1.245:8077"]' 12
expect text-has storage "databases"
tap 'sel:.storage-row[data-kind="quota"][data-origin^="http://192.168.1.245:8077"] .storage-clear'
wait gone 'sel:.storage-row[data-kind="quota"][data-origin^="http://192.168.1.245:8077"]' 12
expect text-has storage "192.168.1.245:8079"
tap 'sel:#forget'
wait text forget-row "Forget everything" 4
tap 'sel:#forget'
wait text sites "Sites" 20
wait quiet 'jihad-never-logged' 3
expect text-lacks sites "192.168.1.245"
launch about:data?pane=forms
wait text forms "hello jihad" 10
expect text-has forms "jihad-data"
tap 'sel:#search'
type hello
wait text forms "Form data" 4
expect text-lacks forms "jihad-data"
launch about:data?pane=forms
wait text forms "hello jihad" 10
tap 'sel:#search'
type zzq
wait text forms "No entry matches" 4
launch about:data?pane=forms
wait text forms "hello jihad" 10
tap 'sel:.form-row[data-value="hello jihad"] .form-remove'
wait text status "Removed" 6
expect text-lacks forms "hello jihad"
tap 'sel:.forms-remove-all'
wait text forms-remove-all-row "entries?" 4
tap 'sel:.forms-remove-all'
wait text forms "Nothing typed" 6
